{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51905","headline":"诮失婢牓诗（原情寄嘲。三首） 三 · 无名氏","name":"诮失婢牓诗（原情寄嘲。三首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"揭牓讳因依，千声叫不归。\n头盘红缕髻，身着紫罗衣。\n夹带无金玉，窝藏有是非。\n请君看赏格，惆怅信音稀。\n（汪立名辑本《白香山诗集·补遗》注引《尧山堂外纪》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}